"url": "https://x.com/responsivelp/status/2110040219730792624"}, {"author_id": "3051747481", "created_at": "2026-10-13T16:08:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110040026893664387"], "id": "2110040026893664387", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Bidhannagar Road to Shreebhumi Durga Puja 2026 | Bus, Auto, Walking Route &amp; Entry Gate - YouTube https://t.co/Gd1oC8nGrM", "url": "https://x.com/responsivelp/status/2110040026893664387"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110037674035941376", "3_2110037752704331778", "3_2110037787844149248", "3_2110037802553655296"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:59:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110037817254719987"], "id": "2110037817254719987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 236, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Kalyani A9 Square.\n\n🎨 Anup Pal.\n\n🌟 The theme is Kedarnath.\n\n👉 The pandal looks absolutely horrible &amp; cheap. Yet another disappointing Durga Puja from Kalyani this year.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/JsnLSDmqSh https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110037817254719987"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110037638329810945", "3_2110037748111609857", "3_2110037776293068800", "3_2110037795192590337"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:59:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110037812028547314"], "id": "2110037812028547314", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 208, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Kalyani Rathtala Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Kalipada Jana, Subhash Jana &amp; Asha Decorators.\n\n🌟 N/A.\n\n👉 It looks decent, but nothing extraordinary. Very disappointed from Kalyani this year.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/mJ9RR3vC9W https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110037812028547314"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110037587209695232", "3_2110037615600963584", "3_2110037679757025280", "3_2110037776762912768"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:59:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110037799948984799"], "id": "2110037799948984799", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 85, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Luminous Club, Kalyani ITI More.\n\n🎨 Pradip Rudra Pal &amp; Sarkar Decorators.\n\n🌟 The theme is Swe Taw Myat Pagoda of Yangon, Myanmar.\n\n👉 It looks horrendous, especially at night. Not expected from this club. Very disappointed from Kalyani this year.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/bS2ijo1G0B https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110037799948984799"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110034583114932224"]}, "author_id": "1340509422582333442", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:47:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110034786899407258"], "id": "2110034786899407258", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 7440, "like_count": 529, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 189, "retweet_count": 86}, "text": "A resounding and timely message from Union Home Minister Shri @AmitShah Ji to the Opposition.\nIndia’s voice belongs to the People of India and cannot be co-opted through manufactured narratives and political theatrics. The nation clearly sees through this hollow drama and stands https://t.co/IH0nzMuAzi", "url": "https://x.com/SuvenduWB/status/2110034786899407258"}, {"author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:46:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110034466572042454"], "id": "2110034466572042454", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 240, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109952867822174465", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Tip to people who don't know. If you value your life and want to comeback home alive and unharmed, never visit this pandal. Pathetic crowd management since time immemorial, exit is all the way other side. It takes 2-3 hours in evening to visit this pandal alone. https://t.co/Lxg9Hp8XyG", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2110034466572042454"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110032182735785985", "3_2110032194664329216", "3_2110032201756934144", "3_2110032209247875072"]}, "author_id": "94562392", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:37:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110032219712704615"], "id": "2110032219712704615", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Cyber Safety &amp; Security Awareness Programme | PM SHRI KV Karimganj\n\nPM SHRI Kendriya Vidyalaya Karimganj, in collaboration with the Sribhumi Branch, Assam Police, organised a Cyber Safety &amp; Security Awareness Programme for students of Classes VIII &amp; IX on 13 October 2026.\n\nThe https://t.co/N0tzbBfg7t", "url": "https://x.com/msinghphy/status/2110032219712704615"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:33:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110031236697579564"], "id": "2110031236697579564", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1166759009967206401", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110030998339817530", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Raushan37499989 @iAK1707 Modern AI videos can look nearly identical to real footage, so certainty is hard from visuals alone. This one shows hallmarks of AI generation (perfect symmetry, cinematic drone motion, seamless hyper-detailed lotus structure with integrated fountains unlikely for a temporary", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2110031236697579564"}, {"author_id": "1537320885480468481", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:31:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110030656051065145"], "id": "2110030656051065145", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3007649773", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110024234437366218", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@biharigurl Isse jyada bheed parso Santosh Mitra Square k opening mei hui thi🤣🤣", "url": "https://x.com/TogetherUss/status/2110030656051065145"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110029055303315456", "3_2110029077994418176"]}, "author_id": "1313326464461283328", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:25:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110029091755982926"], "id": "2110029091755982926", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 212, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nebutala cores used to troll Sreebhumi for opening their pandal early &amp; gathering crowds. Well they're new Sreebhumi now, seeing most pre pujo hopping congestion. Btw having Rintu Das as theme artist for first time has given them their best artistic pandal in recent years though https://t.co/aWv2i4Bb0e", "url": "https://x.com/horek_rokom/status/2110029091755982926"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110026249901096960"]}, "author_id": "874320053386199040", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:14:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110026357497647327"], "id": "2110026357497647327", "in_reply_to_user_id": "292098814", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109968119502651763", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Bagriml Thousands of people standi